": "985226397159650", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307409_985226400492983_8207624562039533088_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Wc_c2M2nEQoQ7kNvwGssyUn&_nc_oc=AdpJZbse33zlJqHRNPEi91z9_uxfVQN2dFywG1H4Q9mQXbjGnL47Zlsi0y606dQw7qQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPTEdoghDy3-t1y83HOYeVFgCKPNfMGYYB8WgsCJkNIMg&oe=6ADE1FC5"}, {"file_name": "TextTool.png", "id": "1229645078120613", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499296201_1229645081453946_2602537216809768206_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ta8c5xqR9rwQ7kNvwF93BkV&_nc_oc=Adphy64C1G8PM-HDNq5jUitMLt8OzNCVhtPTa3QxQLipm2Pq9ZdZYdvoh5rko4cNEmc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNzbRjPxDTTMupy86kxo8M5ut7nEP2vwSmm3kiRssxVww&oe=6ADE2661"}, {"file_name": "emojis.png", "id": "1440095157345894", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831273_1440095160679227_9175729624173159440_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZA5Xu5f3wgMQ7kNvwHgOSJV&_nc_oc=AdoYUmeBlIm0P1R16QJjVmAi9aHa5mLF7Rgyn5kTI9VrTXEsn3T9qjyGFQ8KS1SGnk8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOiftqvKOtdHKnDgPOp9BHvvb2xDHUM4WJOH1lrWpqE_w&oe=6ADE1BC6"}, {"file_name": "drawings.png", "id": "1250279539986138", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830032_1250279543319471_5762355672284679861_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YYvVm2CFsHoQ7kNvwGkOc5H&_nc_oc=Adr8rcj_P46WrfWwWMdDh_bJRmCk9HoF_FlJDmcdXb8k46AQvFcocqn3mMMZ8Y3ymGQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNiWoGkdXZevCoL7EmSSmnhxD0n-ecdyTSuzExYfyZQBw&oe=6ADE1037"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape.png", "id": "758312620198178", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298205_758312623531511_3363769476488943806_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pRYhB1W-UoIQ7kNvwEURM02&_nc_oc=Adr5TmT8u4CzA2cgmljzKKsE8ZvmdfWtIJDqHYCdFZX6SlJ5GdLMSh8HanKHwN77VOw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMtONlPizx9mQatLzjjIbEfMqcvlGnD6jEFbTUNaq6tyQ&oe=6ADE1A3D"}, "display_name": "Dear Metaverse", "keywords": ["messaging", "communication", "mail", "mailbox", "creativity"], "long_description": "Dear You,\nWelcome to Dear Metaverse! \n\nHere, you can use your hands to make wild 3D letters and send them to your friends- Heartfelt confessions, chaotic memes, or whatever weird idea pops into your head. You\u2019ll get stuff too, straight to your own virtual mailbox- sometimes sweet, sometimes unhinged, always surprising.\n\nIt's a space to stay close, be creative, and just have fun with the people you care about.\n\nThis early version includes:\n\u2726 A working mailbox that shows when you\u2019ve got mail\n\u2726 Hand-tracked tools for drawing, writing, and decorating\n\u2726 Fully 3D letters you can grab, open, and explore\n\nSincerely, The Dear Metaverse Team", "short_description": "Dear Metaverse is a delightful VR messaging app for exchanging spatial messages with friends. Use hand-tracked tools to draw, write, and decorate your message, then deliver your message straight to a friend\u2019s virtual mailbox. Will you send heartfelt messages? Or will you create memes and utter chaos?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://studiosyro.com/dm-privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Studio Syro", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://studiosyro.com/dear-metaverse", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "r